he base program manually. It represents a waste of precious time. I can program the computer to do it automatically.", "image": "enpe7n5le01ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 0}, {"time": "23500", "text": "<strong>Martha</strong>: Are you going to use C# to program this new task? <br/>\n<strong>Robert</strong>: No. We are using scripting languages instead of base programming languages. The most commonly used, in cases like this, are Perl, Ruby, and Python. <br/>\n<strong>Martha</strong>: Will it take much time? <br/>\n<strong>Robert</strong>: No, Martha. As there is no need to compile these languages before running them, the process won't take long. <br/>\n<strong>Martha</strong>: Oh, I didn't know that! And, will it be more expensive? <br/>\n<strong>Robert</strong>: No. Actually, these languages are open source. They are available for free access and use, and they don't require additional system components. There haven't ever been any costs for licensing or using them.", "image": "enpe7n5le01ob06re2img02.jpg", "id": 1}, {"time": "71000", "text": "<strong>Martha</strong>: Good! Any other issues? <br/>\n<strong>Robert</strong>: Hmm, I've seen some other issues, but I haven't had much trouble handling them. I'm currently working on two things: Java programming for web applications and COBOL. The task with Java won't take long. Fortunately, there is no need to recompile the code once you use it on one platform and want to run it in another one. The one that worries me a little is the COBOL part. <br/>\n<strong>Martha</strong>: Why? What is the problem with that one? <br/>\n<strong>Robert</strong>: Well, COBOL is a very old programming language. We use it for maintenance of existing applications but not to develop new ones. I suggest migrating the programs based on COBOL to a more modern platform. <br/>\n<strong>Martha</strong>: Well, we'll do it, then.", "image": "enpe7n5le01ob06re2img03.jpg", "id": 2}], "audiosrc": "enpe7n5le01ob06re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": "", "id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "image": "", "id": 0}], "video_src": "enpe7n5le01ob06re5vsc01"}, "type": "video"}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar"}]}